### 登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "demo", "password": "demo123" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token); %}

### 搜索有房酒店
GET http://localhost:8080/api/hotels/search?city=南昌&keyword=万达&checkIn={{$todayPlus7}}&checkOut={{$todayPlus9}}&rooms=1

### 酒店详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/hotels/1?checkIn=2026-08-24&checkOut=2026-08-26

### 下单（每次换一个 requestId）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomTypeId": 1,
  "checkIn": "2026-08-24",
  "checkOut": "2026-08-26",
  "rooms": 1,
  "requestId": "demo-request-001"
}

### 支付
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 我的订单
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 管理员重建 ES
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/es/rebuild
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
